# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
#
# ANON KEY ONLY. Read the security section of Document/Tech-Stack.md before
# adding anything here: an Electron .exe is a ZIP of JavaScript, and every value
# in this file ships inside it readable via `npx asar extract`.
#
# NEVER put here: the service_role key, or a postgresql:// connection string.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Build tooling only — used by `npm run db:types` to regenerate
# packages/shared/database.types.ts from the hosted project.
# Create one at https://supabase.com/dashboard/account/tokens
#
# This one IS a secret, and it is safe here only because it has no VITE_ prefix:
# Vite exposes VITE_* to the renderer and nothing else. Never add VITE_ to it, or
# it ships in the .exe and hands anyone your whole Supabase account.
SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN=sbp_your-access-token-here
